WEBVTT

00:02.120 --> 00:04.320
The Crown Prince's power has already formed.

00:04.880 --> 00:09.560
And has a marriage alliance with Grand General Zu Yue's daughter as long as he remains.

00:09.640 --> 00:12.120
Sikong Xu will never be at ease.

00:12.920 --> 00:17.520
Right after your death Sikong Xu, after repeated advice from his advisors.

00:17.800 --> 00:22.760
Decided to keep the death secret secretly return to the capital strike first.

00:26.920 --> 00:31.480
However on Sikong Xu's way back to the capital when reaching a cliff.

00:31.760 --> 00:37.080
The horse seemed to have been drugged suddenly began running out of control.

00:37.800 --> 00:42.400
Finally Sikong Xu fell off the cliff disappeared without a trace.

00:42.840 --> 00:46.480
The news quickly reached the capital after discussion among court ministers.

00:46.560 --> 00:51.080
Decided to welcome the late Emperor's eldest son Sikong Sheng as the new emperor Father has just passed.

00:51.160 --> 00:56.360
My second brother suffered this misfortune if I follow your suggestion and ascend the throne now.

00:56.440 --> 00:58.440
How will the people view me?

00:58.840 --> 01:03.280
Your Highness the realm cannot be without a ruler for a day state affairs cannot be left without a decision, Your Highness.

01:03.400 --> 01:04.120
No.

01:04.200 --> 01:07.880
Absolutely not Your Highness consider Xuan Kingdom, Your Highness.

01:07.960 --> 01:10.760
After three refusals.

01:11.280 --> 01:16.960
Sikong Sheng finally ascended the throne and changed the era name to Taian the following year.

01:17.040 --> 01:21.400
Posthumously titled the late Emperor Sikong Yao as Zhao historically known as Emperor Xuanzhao.

05:22.000 --> 05:26.500
Emperor Xuanwen.

